## What to expect

Our annual **Open Evening** is the best way to get a feel for the IB Diploma Programme at Česká. Coordinators and subject teachers will be on hand to answer questions, and current IB students will share what the programme is really like.

The evening includes:

- A short introduction to the **MYP and DP** pathways
- **Subject tables** where you can talk to teachers from each group
- A walk through the school, library, and science labs
- Time to ask about **admissions, fees, and timelines**

No registration is required - just come along. We look forward to meeting you.
